      <details class="acc"><summary>How long does shipping take?</summary><div class="acc__b"><p>Orders ship from a US warehouse within 1 to 2 business days and usually arrive in 3 to 5. Shipping is free on orders $40 and up.</p></div></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="sticky" data-sticky aria-hidden="true">
